## Source provenance

The engine in `src/` is derived from a public Claude Code source snapshot
(version 2.1.87). Lab Agent maintains its own branding, configuration, provider
setup, launcher, diagnostics, documentation, and build/release tooling.

The `src/cli/` runtime directory was missing from the initial repository
snapshot and was restored from public mirrors that match the same source
snapshot:

- `https://github.com/uzuma645/not-clawd-code`
  commit `af7d9c673a3815bc0562965421d2d0c5127807db`
- `https://github.com/mehmoodosman/claude-code`
  commit `30a1fa0f5d84b23f05664378d4863dd42aef0952`

Verification performed before import:

- `src/main.tsx` from the mirror differs from this repository only in Lab Agent
  branding (`claude` → `lab-agent`, `Claude Code` → `Lab Agent`).
- `src/cli/print.ts` has the same SHA-256 in both mirrors:
  `77bb8bed6ebe3e5fbc3c6521dcddab479af8ce9e3df82b2a103c27bf14cc573d`.

The imported files are used under the repository's Apache-2.0 license. Anyone
redistributing Lab Agent should independently review the licensing and
trademark implications of the underlying snapshot for their jurisdiction.

